cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BRIDGE-D in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "BRIDGE-D: Bridging Instruments for Depression"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE_ME/BRIDGE-D"
abstract: >
  Instrument-as-data toolkit for scoring and comparing co-administered
  depression scales, with agreement, classification and equipercentile
  linking, plus a known-truth simulation module for software validation
  and sample-size planning.
authors:
  - name: "BRIDGE-D contributors"
